# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
# When using edit.quadraaudio.com or admin.quadraaudio.com, send /editor to /editor/
/editor /editor/ 308

# SPA-style rewrite: pages created in the visual editor live at /pages/<slug>/
# without needing a rebuild. Cloudflare's 200 "proxy" rewrites require the
# destination to reference :splat, so we pass the slug through as a query
# param — /p/ reads it directly via useSearchParams (with a pathname-based
# fallback in case a request ever reaches /p/ without it).
/pages/*  /p/index.html?slug=:splat  200
